1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:03,797
(Howard:)Hey, what up, science bitches?

2
00:00:05,213 --> 00:00:07,883
(Howard:)May I introduce my special lady friend,
Summer.

3
00:00:08,049 --> 00:00:09,799
Howard, I told you, touching's extra.

4
00:00:09,968 --> 00:00:11,598
(Howard:)Right. Sorry.

5
00:00:12,554 --> 00:00:15,094
(Leonard(to Sheldon):)Here comes our new boss. Be polite.

6
00:00:15,265 --> 00:00:16,515
MAN:
Hi, fellas.

7
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:18,563
- Eric Gablehauser.
- Howard Wolowitz.

8
00:00:18,726 --> 00:00:21,436
(Gablehouser:)Howard, nice to meet you. And you are?

9
00:00:22,438 --> 00:00:24,778
(Sheldon:)An actual real scientist.

10
00:00:27,986 --> 00:00:29,616
(Sheldon:)How was that?

11
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:33,574
(Sheldon:)I can't believe he fired me.

12
00:00:33,741 --> 00:00:36,121
(Leonard:)You did call him
a glorified science teacher...

13
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:40,876
(Leonard:)...whose last successful experiment
was lighting his own farts.

14
00:00:41,332 --> 00:00:45,712
In my defense, I prefaced that by saying
"with all due respect."

